@SmartSolarMicrogridAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5014

### API health check
GET {{SmartSolarMicrogridAPI_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Database connection check
GET {{SmartSolarMicrogridAPI_HostAddress}}/api/health/database
Accept: application/json

### Register a solar station (Backoffice token)
POST {{SmartSolarMicrogridAPI_HostAddress}}/api/stations
Authorization: Bearer {{backofficeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stationName": "Colombo Central Hub",
  "stationCode": "COL-01",
  "latitude": 6.9271,
  "longitude": 79.8612,
  "addressLine": "1 Galle Road",
  "city": "Colombo",
  "capacityKwh": 500,
  "totalBays": 4
}

### Update a station schedule (Backoffice or GridOperator token)
PUT {{SmartSolarMicrogridAPI_HostAddress}}/api/stations/{{stationId}}/schedules/{{slotId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{gridOperatorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startTime": "2026-10-01T08:00:00Z",
  "endTime": "2026-10-01T10:00:00Z",
  "totalPositions": 3,
  "status": "Available"
}

### Deactivate a station (Backoffice token) - 400 while it has Pending/Approved reservations
PUT {{SmartSolarMicrogridAPI_HostAddress}}/api/stations/{{stationId}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{backofficeToken}}

### Verify scanned QR code (Grid Operator or Backoffice token)
POST {{SmartSolarMicrogridAPI_HostAddress}}/api/transfers/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{gridOperatorToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "qrToken": "qr-token-example-12345"
}

### Finalize energy transfer job (Grid Operator or Backoffice token)
POST {{SmartSolarMicrogridAPI_HostAddress}}/api/transfers/{{reservationId}}/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{gridOperatorToken}}

